  ],
  "translation": "N bɛna a ka masakɛlaw ni a ka donnikɛlaw, a ka kansatigiw, a ka faamaw ni a ka gɛlɛnw bila jɔngɔ la; kabini u bɛna sunɔ sunɔ san bɛɛ, u tɛna wuli — Masakɛla Yawe Tsofew ka kuma ko nin; a tɔgɔ de ye Yawe Tsofew.",
